cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the information below."
title: "Fusion Reactor Simulator"
abstract: >-
  A time-resolved fusion reactor simulation engine with a zero-dimensional power balance
  and a 1.5D radial transport model (electron/ion temperature, density and poloidal flux
  on the normalised toroidal-flux coordinate) coupled to a fixed-boundary Grad-Shafranov
  equilibrium solver, with Sauter bootstrap current, NBI/RF sources, beam-target fusion,
  sawteeth, ELMs and NTMs. Covers magnetic confinement (tokamak, spherical tokamak,
  stellarator) and other schemes; verified against manufactured solutions and validated
  against ITER, JET DTE2, SPARC, EU DEMO and NIF reference values. Includes a built-in
  publication-quality figure engine (SVG/PDF) and multi-core parameter scans.
